    {
      "id": "croesus_intro_1",
      "context": "Croesus 菜单功能说明",
      "text": "After completing a Catacombs or",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "整句合并后按颜色分段:游戏里 Catacombs 是绿色高亮,合并译文里把「地牢」单独留在绿色那一段。Kuudra 在原文第二行也是高亮,但第二行已被 continuation 删掉,只能落进灰色段。",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "完成一次地牢或 Kuudra 挑战后，如果你没有开启奖励箱，我会替你保存在这里!",
      "raw": "§7After completing a §aCatacombs §7or",
      "segments": [
        {
          "color": "§7",
          "text": "After completing a ",
          "zh": "完成一次"
        },
        {
          "color": "§a",
          "text": "Catacombs ",
          "zh": "地牢"
        },
        {
          "color": "§7",
          "text": "or",
          "zh": "或 Kuudra 挑战后，如果你没有开启奖励箱，我会替你保存在这里!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "croesus_intro_2",
      "context": "接上一行",
      "text": "Kuudra run, if you don't open a",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "continuation": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
